#: ../../src/pyvista_wasm/readers.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_wasm.readers.XMLPolyDataReader:3
msgid ""
"Implements the VTK::IOXML mapping (issue #784). Reads ASCII data arrays with"
" the standard library; binary/base64 arrays are not supported yet."
